          </button>
<button class="filter-pill px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wide cursor-pointer transition-all bg-surface-container-highest/60 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-highest" data-filter="feedback" type="button">
            Feedback
          </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ Accordion -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-space-md" id="faq-list">
<!-- Question 1 (Expanded by Default) -->
<div class="faq-item rounded-[18px] bg-surface-container/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-md group" data-category="membership">
<button aria-expanded="true" class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-space-lg text-left gap-space-md cursor-pointer transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-md min-w-0">
<span class="faq-number font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary-container shrink-0">01</span>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface tracking-normal group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                How to become the member of this site?
              </span>
</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px] shrink-0 rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300">
              expand_more
            </span>
</button>
<div class="faq-content px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-0 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed">
<p class="max-w-3xl">
              Click ‘Join Now’ on any page or navigation bar, select your preferred pass (Monthly at $10/month or Yearly at $100/year), complete the secure payment process, and fill out your account registration details. Once confirmed, your account gains instantaneous access to our entire vault of 50+ Michelin-grade premium recipes, chef notes, and member features.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Question 2 -->
<div class="faq-item rounded-[18px] bg-surface-container/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-md group" data-category="membership">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-space-lg text-left gap-space-md cursor-pointer transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-md min-w-0">
<span class="faq-number font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-outline shrink-0">02</span>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface tracking-normal group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Will there be any subscription charges?
              </span>
</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[24px] shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
              expand_more
            </span>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-0 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed">
<p class="max-w-3xl">
              Yes. We offer two transparent subscription passes: Monthly ($10) or Yearly ($100, saving $20) for full catalog access and exclusive executive formulations. Foundational basic recipes and free tips remain complimentary forever with no charges or registration required.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Question 3 -->
<div class="faq-item rounded-[18px] bg-surface-container/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-md group" data-category="recipes">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-space-lg text-left gap-space-md cursor-pointer transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-md min-w-0">
<span class="faq-number font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-outline shrink-0">03</span>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface tracking-normal group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                How to view the recipes and tips? Will there be any charges for that?
              </span>
</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[24px] shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
              expand_more
            </span>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-0 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed">
<p class="max-w-3xl">
              Free recipes and tips can be explored freely without charge or registration by visiting the Free Recipes and Free Tips sections. The full premium catalog—including executive masterclasses, exact sous-vide temperature curves, and secret ingredient ratios—requires an active paid membership.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Question 4 -->
<div class="faq-item rounded-[18px] bg-surface-container/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-md group" data-category="contests">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-space-lg text-left gap-space-md cursor-pointer transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-md min-w-0">
<span class="faq-number font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-outline shrink-0">04</span>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface tracking-normal group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                I am not the registered member of the site. Can I participate in the contest held?
              </span>
</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[24px] shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
              expand_more
            </span>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-0 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed">
<p class="max-w-3xl">
              Yes, general users and guests can participate freely by submitting their original recipes or tips to any active contest. Our culinary challenges are open to everyone to encourage domestic gastronomic talent.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Question 5 -->
<div class="faq-item rounded-[18px] bg-surface-container/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-md group" data-category="recipes">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between p-space-lg text-left gap-space-md cursor-pointer transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-md min-w-0">
<span class="faq-number font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-outline shrink-0">05</span>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface tracking-normal group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                How to upload or post the recipes and tips?
              </span>
</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[24px] shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
              expand_more
            </span>
</button>
<div class="faq-content hidden px-space-lg pb-space-lg pt-0 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed">
<p class="max-w-3xl">
              Logged-in members can simply use the ‘+ Add Recipe’ or ‘+ Add Tip’ actions accessible directly from their member dashboard or the recipe library. Fill in your ingredient quantities, step-by-step procedures, and upload a dish photo for community publication.
            </p>
</div>
